em information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8108) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K (32 threads) - 63.76 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith `scroll_following_visible_characters` enabled on `RichTextLabel`, the scrollbar will be sized incorrectly the first time it renders:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/85b861f4-de94-4d8c-8665-a8dee1e148b6\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTo see the issue, start the main scene in the MRP as shown in the video above. It will automatically set some dialogue. On the first render of the scrollbar, it will be huge and cover the entire `RichTextLabel`. If you press space, it will call the exact same code again, but this time the scrollbar will render correctly.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[scrollbar-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22870525/scrollbar-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111